==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 800,000 and increases by 40,000 with each stage.
*Unlimited [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay between them is 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*The boss, [[Le'Grim]], spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay between them is 38.67~45.33 seconds<sup>1,160~1,360f</sup>; 3 more spawn with the same delay after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>.
*2 [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>200f</sup> and 173.33 seconds<sup>5,200f</sup> respectively.
*2 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay between them is 45.33~49.33 seconds<sup>1,360~1,480f</sup>; 2 more spawn with the same delay after 213.33 seconds<sup>6,400f</sup>.

