==Strategies==
Due to the high attack power of the enemies, as well as Le'Grim's short animation, it is strongly recommended to rely on many cheap meatshields as protection unless attempting a permafreeze or cheese approach.

Players who own [[Tecoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Lufalan Pasalan]] are strongly recommended to use him, as he demolishes the support enemies while chipping constantly at the boss. Strategies involving this Uber or any other who outranges the boss should involve a tight defence as well as the use of the cannon ([[Ototo Corps|Breakerblast or Holy Blast]]) mainly as a mean to prevent Zuche from burrowing and attacking said unit.

